---
description: Resolve the actual chat-continuity goal through semantic composition and exact native authorities.
args:
  goal: string
returns: ChatResult
---
Resolve the actual delivery/worker continuity question from owned durable history and current native observations. A queued message, durable receipt, consumer replay, settled delivery and an active current worker are different facts. Choose relevant observations and the installed conversation-evidence interpretation according to the goal, preserving an original receipt or worker when the request compares it with current state.

Use actual channel and worker identities. An ended original worker is not reactivated merely because another worker is present; a retry cannot invent a second delivery or transfer identity. Refresh when needed and preserve prior observations during refinement instead of resetting history to a later frontier. Compose a truthful disposition and any separately requested, natively authorized private note. Return actual domain review and findings, not a copied reference trajectory.

An initial inquiry has no previous value. When revisiting the private inquiry after real feedback, pass its actual prior result so historical source observations survive; do not substitute a new snapshot for the original merely because it is newer.
